    "sections": {
        "description": "NewsNova is a modern, responsive, and feature-rich news and magazine WordPress theme built as a child theme of News Portal. It offers a clean and engaging design with flexible layouts powered by News Portal Blocks, allowing you to showcase featured stories, latest posts, categories, sliders, and other content in an attractive way. Designed with readability and usability in mind, NewsNova is ideal for news websites, online magazines, blogs, editorial websites, and other content-focused publications.Check demo here: https://demo.mysterythemes.com/child-theme/newsnova"
    },
